   213	          ]
   214	        }
   215	      ],
   216	    // More projects...
   217	    }
   218	    ```
   219	  - `vulnerability2function.json`: This JSON file contains a manual mapping of each vulnerability encountered in the dataset with the corresponding vulnerable functions. The keys represent the CVE identifiers, and the values are arrays containing the paths to the vulnerable functions within the codebase. For example:
